{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sDF1n6Qbkb1793024343.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>塞爾維亞議會選舉由反對派「學生名單」勝出，前總統武契奇承認落敗。在北京，外交部表示，尊重各國人民的自主選擇，願同塞爾維亞新一屆政府一道努力，推動中塞關係行穩致遠。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆表示：「中方一貫秉持不干涉內政原則，尊重各國人民的自主選擇。我們高度重視中塞關係發展。願同塞爾維亞新一屆政府一道努力，在相互尊重、平等互利基礎上，弘揚傳統友誼，鞏固政治互信，拓展務實合作，推動中塞關係行穩致遠。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.615077+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:38:28.827874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.297279+00:00","content_hash":"43e5ebc6430b4c9fe02b4d893e978a8c95d89dd04ece11a62640cc215a491cc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.615077+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}